provenance hand
note The tick scan of runAI(true) runs only when the template has a see-creature script, over every known playable (players and summons; the gates read the acting player), before invalid desires are pruned and before a desire is picked. A nested runAI(false) does not scan.
note in_range is the 3D distance strictly below the see range, centre to centre: DefaultSeeRange (450) for NPCs, the template aggro range for raid and grand bosses.
note Non-raid NPCs keep a seen set, cleared at spawn: a creature in it gets no call; a creature in it found out of range leaves it. Raid bosses ignore the set. moving names who is moving (creature, npc or none). calls is the number of see-creature calls for the creature this tick; seen_after is whether it is in the seen set afterwards.
