provenance hand
note lookNeighbor (called by behaviors) runs at most once per 30 s per NPC: it returns when now - last < 30000 ms; otherwise it stores now as last before scanning, whatever the scan finds. last starts at 0.
note The scan covers every known creature, NPCs included, within the see range by the known-list rule (3D, inclusive, see range plus both collision radii), with no seen set. Gates: the acting player (if any) not spawn-protected, not flying, visible; a silent-moving creature only for raid bosses or templates that see through; at most 500 Z apart.
note Throttle rows give elapsed (now - last, ms) and runs; gate rows give the creature and calls.
row throttle-first elapsed=first runs=true
row throttle-29999 elapsed=29999 runs=false
row throttle-30000 elapsed=30000 runs=true
row player creature=player protected=false flying=false invisible=false silent=false raid=false see_through=false dz=0 calls=1
